        "notes": [
          "All 170 bundled audio files under public/samples/ (78 Grand, 52 Upright, 15 Rhodes Mk I, 25 Wurlitzer EP200) are verbatim onset-trimmed, faded, and Ogg Vorbis q4 re-encoded cuts from inputs/samples/ with no pitch-shifting, time-stretching, or layering baked into the files.",
          "Fine tuning offsets from upstream SFZ/Data metadata are applied at runtime via AudioBufferSourceNode.playbackRate for accurate A440 equal temperament.",
          "Rhodes Mk I is recorded at a single dynamic per note in the pack; velocity dynamics are shaped at runtime via gain and dynamic lowpass filtering.",
          "Phase 2 connects Piano (Layers A/B, 6 types, models, performance/acoustic/timbre controls, SUSTPED/PSTICK), Layer Effects (Mod 1, Mod 2, Delay, Amp Sim/EQ, Compressor, Reverb, Rotary via To Rotary, Focus/Group/Global/Bypass), Master Level, and Pitch Stick. Organ, Synth, and Program controls remain truthfully decorative."
        ]
